  "description": "Republic of Ireland District Electoral Divisions/Wards as at 1994, assembled from Connacht (= 1986 boundaries), Leinster 1994, Munster (= 1983 boundaries), Ulster (= 1963 boundaries). Very slightly modified version of Electoral Divisions 1997. The difference between this and that map is that the electoral division of Cherry Orchard B was renamed to Carna (source used - County Borough of Dublin (Wards) (Amendment) Regulations, 1997). District electoral divisions and wards were both renamed to electoral divisions in 1996 via the Local Government Act 1994, hence the new \"WARDORDED\" attribute",
